# Regenerable bulk data. All of this is rebuilt by the pipeline in Scripts/
# and is far too large for git (2.2 GB in total).
#
#   DEM/       12 COP30 tiles + the 30 m mosaic, downloaded by 01_dem_prep.py
#              and 10_dem30.py from the public copernicus-dem-30m AWS bucket
#   Viewshed/  line-of-sight rasters, rebuilt by 11_visibility30.py in ~172 s
#   Solar/     sunrise alignment and shadow rasters, from 04_solar.py
#   OSM/       Overpass extracts, refetched by 03_osm.py
#
# Kept in the repo: Scripts/, Results/, Web/, the QGIS project, the A2 print
# sheet, brand.json and this README.

DEM/
Viewshed/
Solar/
OSM/

# QGIS scratch
*.qgz~
*.qgd
